            <note corresp="#d121-f3" n="3" xml:id="d121-f3-content">
                <p>Additional documentation regarding the Remón assassination and the Guizado trial
                    is in Department of State, Central File 719.11; <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ibid.</hi>, ARA Files: Lot 60 D 667, Panama 1955—Political Local; <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ibid.</hi>, Panama City Embassy Files: Lot 63 F 57,
                    361.1 Remón Assassination; and <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.:</hi> Lot 63 F 59,
                    361.1 Remón Assassination.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
